      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i get why u say that but it sounds so extreme. the dizziness is just like a little head spin for a second when i get up, it's not like i'm actually passing out or anything. i just feel like if i can just get past this first week or so it'll settle down. is there really no way to just manage it at home? like maybe if i take it at a different time of day or take a little extra salt or something to keep my pressure from dipping too low? i really hate the idea of sitting in a waiting room for hours just for something that feels minor.",
